DESCRIPTION:Students will make full-size farmhouse room table that is both 
 incredibly durable and wonderfully timeless.  In two days\, you will learn
  about the fundamentals of table construction and basic woodshop skills.  
 Instructors will expertly guide you through each step\, so all experience 
 levels are welcome. Customize the table size to fit in your home. The maxi
 mum table size we are able to accommodate is 7’ x 3’
SUMMARY:Farmhouse Table
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0Hu000000TbwmKAC
END:VEVENT
