DTSTAMP:20260817T010806Z
UID:21cac721-6523-4965-9cd0-2c1e929786d1
DTSTART:20261220T150000
DTEND:20261220T200000
DESCRIPTION:We’ll get that old dusty hand plane back into action in this 
 one day workshop! We will polish\, sharpen\, and tune up the body of your 
 hand plane to get it into user ready condition.
SUMMARY:Hand Plane Restoration
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0Hu000000cWg8KAE
